NOTICE — scope of this license and vendored third-party content
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT grant above covers the AgentEnhancements integration layer authored
in this repository: unified-integration/, mcp-servers/ (the in-house
agent_browser server), plugin-catalog/, scripts/, skills/ generated index,
docs/, and the repository-level configuration files.

The following directories are VENDORED COPIES of third-party projects and are
distributed under their own upstream licenses, which take precedence over the
MIT grant above for anything inside those directories:

